    ## Queued
    - [ ] q-1 - queued item (since 2026-11-25)
    ## Done
    - [x] d-1 - shipped item (done 2026-11-25)
--- data/done-archive.md:
    # Done archive
    
    <!-- Generated by tasks-axi from beads; read-only. Do not edit. -->
    
    ## Done
